     If successful, tthhrr__sseellff() will return zero, otherwise -1 is returned, and
     _e_r_r_n_o is set to indicate the error.

EERRRROORRSS
     The tthhrr__sseellff() operation may return the following errors:

     [EFAULT]           The memory pointed to by the _i_d argument is not valid.

